{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "03263",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.03,
      "end_seconds": 4.45,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "good evening, doctor, thanks for seeing me"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.86,
      "end_seconds": 12.27,
      "duration_seconds": 4.41,
      "text": "Yes, have a seat. Tell me what's going on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 13.58,
      "end_seconds": 18.57,
      "duration_seconds": 4.99,
      "text": "Good morning, doctor. I came along to help out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 19.32,
      "end_seconds": 23.36,
      "duration_seconds": 4.04,
      "text": "Yes, that's no problem at all. Please sit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 24.46,
      "end_seconds": 31.44,
      "duration_seconds": 6.98,
      "text": "Hmm, it's fever and shivers, doctor. He didn't want to come, but I insisted."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 32.83,
      "end_seconds": 36.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "How long has this been bothering you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 37.52,
      "end_seconds": 40.07,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "I'd say three weeks, maybe."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 40.97,
      "end_seconds": 44.95,
      "duration_seconds": 3.98,
      "text": "I think it's been nearer a month, actually"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 45.51,
      "end_seconds": 49.97,
      "duration_seconds": 4.46,
      "text": "Okay, so roughly three to four weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 51.43,
      "end_seconds": 52.45,
      "duration_seconds": 1.02,
      "text": "Yeah, roughly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 54.25,
      "end_seconds": 57.89,
      "duration_seconds": 3.64,
      "text": "rate it for me, mild, moderate or severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 59.2,
      "end_seconds": 64.79,
      "duration_seconds": 5.59,
      "text": "Maybe a six out of ten on a bad day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 66.47,
      "end_seconds": 68.46,
      "duration_seconds": 1.99,
      "text": "Any other symptoms with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 70.05,
      "end_seconds": 78.98,
      "duration_seconds": 8.93,
      "text": "it usually comes with cloudy smelly urine. The cloudy smelly urine? That's been for two weeks"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 80.18,
      "end_seconds": 83.84,
      "duration_seconds": 3.66,
      "text": "Do you take any prescribed or over-the-counter medicines?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 85.25,
      "end_seconds": 93.92,
      "duration_seconds": 8.67,
      "text": "he takes tamsulosin, 0.4 milligrams, at night it's hydrocortisone cream, when needed for the eczema, doctor"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 94.45,
      "end_seconds": 95.41,
      "duration_seconds": 0.96,
      "text": "Mm, okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 96.28,
      "end_seconds": 102.69,
      "duration_seconds": 6.41,
      "text": "he is on a urinary catheter, in place, I give it to him"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 104.71,
      "end_seconds": 107.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.62,
      "text": "Roughly how long on that one?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 108.25,
      "end_seconds": 110.19,
      "duration_seconds": 1.94,
      "text": "About a year now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 111.91,
      "end_seconds": 114.59,
      "duration_seconds": 2.68,
      "text": "Okay, what about your medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 115.77,
      "end_seconds": 127.2,
      "duration_seconds": 11.43,
      "text": "Yes, an enlarged prostate. My neighbour said I should get it looked at. I thought it would sort itself out, but it hasn't."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 128.56,
      "end_seconds": 129.95,
      "duration_seconds": 1.39,
      "text": "Is that everything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 135.52,
      "end_seconds": 138.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.6,
      "text": "Eczema, for about ten years"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 139.86,
      "end_seconds": 145.63,
      "duration_seconds": 5.77,
      "text": "okay, I can see an enlarged prostate in your file as well"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 158.34,
      "end_seconds": 163.1,
      "duration_seconds": 4.76,
      "text": "Any inherited conditions that you know of in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 164.75,
      "end_seconds": 167.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "My daughter has type 1 diabetes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 169.25,
      "end_seconds": 174.02,
      "duration_seconds": 4.77,
      "text": "Do you react to any medicines or foods? Any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 175.87,
      "end_seconds": 178.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "yes, trimethoprim. I get a rash"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 180.07,
      "end_seconds": 181.43,
      "duration_seconds": 1.36,
      "text": "Do you smoke?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 183.26,
      "end_seconds": 187.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.94,
      "text": "No, I've never smoked in my life."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 189.25,
      "end_seconds": 192.17,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "What do you do during the day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 193.22,
      "end_seconds": 196.42,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "I look after my grandchildren most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 201.14,
      "end_seconds": 203.32,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "do you do any exercise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 204.75,
      "end_seconds": 207.22,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "I swim twice a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 208.12,
      "end_seconds": 210.17,
      "duration_seconds": 2.05,
      "text": "Is there someone at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 211.32,
      "end_seconds": 214.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.67,
      "text": "My husband and I live above the shop"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 215.83,
      "end_seconds": 221.63,
      "duration_seconds": 5.8,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any vomiting, cough, fall or back pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 222.93,
      "end_seconds": 228.24,
      "duration_seconds": 5.31,
      "text": "I haven't had vomiting, cough, fall or back pain, no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 229.18,
      "end_seconds": 232.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "Any problems with your joints or muscles?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 233.2,
      "end_seconds": 235.0,
      "duration_seconds": 1.8,
      "text": "no, nothing there"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 237.33,
      "end_seconds": 239.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "Let me quickly check your readings."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 251.7,
      "end_seconds": 253.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "Okay, this won't take long..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 272.46,
      "end_seconds": 281.71,
      "duration_seconds": 9.25,
      "text": "Okay: SpO2 98 percent on room air, blood pressure 111 over 74, temperature 38.1, pulse is 108 beats a minute."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 283.39,
      "end_seconds": 285.08,
      "duration_seconds": 1.69,
      "text": "Is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 286.63,
      "end_seconds": 289.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.05,
      "text": "That's fine, I'll explain it soon."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 291.39,
      "end_seconds": 295.07,
      "duration_seconds": 3.68,
      "text": "Right, let's have a proper look at you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 296.76,
      "end_seconds": 298.7,
      "duration_seconds": 1.94,
      "text": "Let me feel here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 316.23,
      "end_seconds": 323.13,
      "duration_seconds": 6.9,
      "text": "The catheter bag has cloudy urine and there is tenderness above the pubic bone."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 325.88,
      "end_seconds": 328.91,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "Good, you can sit up again."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 336.42,
      "end_seconds": 341.14,
      "duration_seconds": 4.72,
      "text": "Having listened and examined, this is probably a catheter-related urinary infection."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 341.91,
      "end_seconds": 345.4,
      "duration_seconds": 3.49,
      "text": "I'm scared it's something bad is it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 346.01,
      "end_seconds": 356.71,
      "duration_seconds": 10.7,
      "text": "I understand the worry at the moment I'd say it's a catheter-related urinary infection, and we'll know more once the blood tests is back"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 369.53,
      "end_seconds": 373.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "I think blood tests makes sense here, for fever."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 373.94,
      "end_seconds": 376.65,
      "duration_seconds": 2.71,
      "text": "where would I go for that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 378.73,
      "end_seconds": 391.61,
      "duration_seconds": 12.88,
      "text": "I'm going to order a urine culture, for possible urinary infection. For this, co-amoxiclav, 625 milligrams, three times a day, seven days. That should help with catheter urinary infection."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 393.27,
      "end_seconds": 395.08,
      "duration_seconds": 1.81,
      "text": "Thank you, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 397.1,
      "end_seconds": 402.2,
      "duration_seconds": 5.1,
      "text": "change the the catheter and drink plenty have I covered everything you wanted?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 403.44,
      "end_seconds": 405.09,
      "duration_seconds": 1.65,
      "text": "That's clear, thanks."
    }
  ]
}